WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.500
Your Honor, I object to this entire line of questioning.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.000
The witness clearly has no knowledge of the events of that night.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Ben Matlock will prove that my client is innocent of all charges.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Ladies and gentlemen of the jury, please consider the evidence carefully.
